From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 01:56:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/27] fix: FocusDistance serialization name corrupted every
 XML it touched

The reflected member was registered with the display label "Focus
Distance (m)" as its serialization NAME. Spaces and parentheses are
illegal in XML attribute names, so every file serializing the component
(layers, prefabs, schematyc entities, level saves) was written malformed
and failed to parse back. Renamed to "FocusDistance"; existing broken
files are repairable by textually replacing the old attribute name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017nykaDjTHxHDSo11CsYx6M
---
 .../CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h           | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h
index 0bfd4bc9..9a715d4c 100644
--- a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h
+++ b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h
@@ -140,7 +140,7 @@ public:
 			'aptr', "Aperture", "Aperture (f-number)",
 			"Lower f-number = shallower depth of field.", 5.6f);
 		desc.AddMember(&CCinematicCameraComponent::m_focusDistance,
-			'fdst', "Focus Distance (m)", "Focus Distance (m)",
+			'fdst', "FocusDistance", "Focus Distance (m)",
 			"Distance to the sharp focus plane.", 5.0f);
 
 		desc.AddMember(&CCinematicCameraComponent::m_focalStepMode,
